{
  "schema": "starlit.story.optional_midpoint.v1",
  "status": "text_only_not_bound",
  "note": "第49-72章可选调查插话，全为新写的中途对白，并遵守12年后与结局前的身份时间线。",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "ch049.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch049",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch049.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch049.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "邮站老板",
          "text": "画像上的人当年没救回我弟弟，可这块木牌是他亲手钉的。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch049.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "我会把两件事都告诉后来者。救过人不等于不必面对失败。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch050.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch050",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch050.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch050.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "墙边女童",
          "text": "地图说药房就在街对面，可我从出生起没走过那道门。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch050.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "先让两边医师知道你的病情，再去改那张只会画墙的地图。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch051.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch051",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch051.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch051.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "山间老妇",
          "text": "他修桥时从不说自己是谁，倒总问我们哪里最容易滑倒。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch051.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "我小时候也被他这样问过。原来有些习惯十二年都没有变。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch052.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch052",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch052.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch052.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "驿站老板",
          "text": "照片上的人如今有的胖了，有的头发白了，我差点认不出来。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch052.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "不认得也没关系。能坐在一起把这些年讲完，已经很难得。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch053.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch053",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch053.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch053.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "旧码头石匠",
          "text": "纪念碑写得越漂亮，有些家属就越不愿来看。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch053.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "那就把他们真正想留下的话写进去，不必人人赞美我们。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch054.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch054",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch054.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch054.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "年轻副队长",
          "text": "诺依会先听我们提出什么办法，不急着告诉谁当过英雄。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch054.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "从你们自己的地图开始。人长大不意味着必须复制上一代。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch055.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch055",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch055.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch055.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "房屋管理员",
          "text": "那户人家的旧地契还在，可街坊已经将房间分给别人。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch055.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "不能只保护一方。先查住户去处和可用的临时住房。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch056.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch056",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch056.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch056.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "志愿登记员",
          "text": "有人要我们先收报名费才允许救人，这还是旧公会的规矩。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch056.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "把费用用于哪儿写清楚。紧急救援不该先确认人交没交钱。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch057.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch057",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch057.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch057.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "摆摊老妇",
          "text": "我的调料不够正宗，他们总说我就不该在广场卖。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch057.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "伊泽",
          "text": "你可以把自己这些年改过的做法也写进食谱，那是你的生活。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch058.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch058",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch058.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch058.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "护车卫兵",
          "text": "有人追维莎不是为了抓罪犯，是为了拿回她车里的原始档案。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch058.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "先保护她和证物，也要给那些受害者留查阅的机会。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch059.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch059",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch059.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch059.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "志愿木匠",
          "text": "我愿修屋顶，不愿拿剑。他们却说我的名字不能写在贡献表上。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch059.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "谁说保护城市只有一种做法？先把你的实际工作登记进去。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch060.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch060",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch060.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch060.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "能源学徒",
          "text": "新灯网的连接方式看起来乱，却每个节点都有自己的开关。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch060.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "缇珐",
          "text": "复杂一点也值得。至少没有人能偷偷替所有地区决定熄灯。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch061.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch061",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch061.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch061.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "星帆船员",
          "text": "在海上找不到北，我还能看浪；在天上连浪也没了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch061.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "那就学会读新的风。别拿旧海图装作什么都懂。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch062.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch062",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch062.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch062.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "实验室残响",
          "text": "试验最开始是为了救下那些本来会生病的人。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch062.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "维莎",
          "text": "也正因为最初帮助过人，后来的错误才更不能被我们掩盖。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch063.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch063",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch063.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch063.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "父亲教我磨小木灯时，总先说慢一点，别割伤手。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch063.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "那一面也该留下。你认识的澄舟，不应只剩下世界的秘密。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch064.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch064",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch064.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch064.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "天衡旧书记",
          "text": "这些未来没有发生，就被算成了不需要保护的东西。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch064.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "它们不属于已经发生的历史，也不该因此被判没有价值。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch065.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch065",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch065.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch065.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "第七席的旧影",
          "text": "没有永远正确的人，就没有永远稳定的秩序。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch065.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "有人能质疑和修正，才是让秩序有机会继续存在。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch066.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch066",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch066.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch066.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "天桥守护者",
          "text": "有人拒绝接入灯网，你们还把他们的声音写在公开屏幕上？"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch066.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "是，因为共同生活的前提不是每个人必须先投赞成票。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch067.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch067",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch067.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch067.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "永昼学童",
          "text": "妈妈说我每天都长大，可我从来没学过明年的算术。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch067.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "你可以喜欢现在，也可以说想要不同的明天。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch068.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch068",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch068.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch068.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "长廊的澄舟幻影",
          "text": "你若回来，就不必再为任何人难过。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch068.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "我想念他，可真正的父亲不会用所有人的明天交换我的安慰。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch069.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch069",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch069.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch069.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "街角工匠",
          "text": "这栋屋子我每天都能建到一半，明天又回到第一块砖。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch069.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "如果你愿意，我们可以去看看外面真正能建成的屋顶。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch070.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch070",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch070.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch070.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "七地居民代表",
          "text": "我们仍不赞成同一个办法，但总算能坐下来读同一份风险。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch070.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "维莎",
          "text": "意见不会因写进附件就消失。下一次讨论还要让他们发言。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch071.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch071",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch071.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch071.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "赫西安",
          "text": "我记得每一次求援无人回应的夜晚，不想让任何人再经历。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch071.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "诺依",
          "text": "我不会否认那些夜晚。可你也不能替今天所有人取消他们的选择。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch072.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch072",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch072.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch072.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "潮歌老渔夫",
          "text": "这只手灯不像母灯那样亮，风一大还会摇。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch072.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "它本来就不是一盏永不熄灭的灯。有人肯继续点亮就够了。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    }
  ]
}
